// Test: $* repeats a Char as the one-character text it is (D-27, decided by
// the author 2026-11-25): a buffer of n bytes is `0x00 $* n`. Three engines
// already took it; zyjs refused it until then.
z = 0x00
b = z $* 4
c = "" 0x00 0x00 0x00 0x00
>> b$# " " (b#?)[1] " " (b == c) ¶
>> 'é' $* 3 " " (0x41 $* 0)$# ¶
// Anything else is no text
!? { >> [1] $* 2 ¶ } :! ##Type { >> "type " _err ¶ }
